# Once the first remembered cube has been shredded, a later pickup of that
# stale memory must error in place.  Retargeting the remaining cube would let
# the following give shred it and incorrectly clear the room.
name Stale Nearest Does Not Retarget
dim 8 8
commands nearest pickup giveto end
ent worker 3 5
ent cube 3 2 1
ent cube 5 2 2
ent shredder 3 6
goal shred_all
